{"kind":"article","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/vigramsdk\/step1gettingstarted"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.vigram.sdk\/documentation\/VigramSDK"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To connect VigramSDK in this example we will use "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/www.swift.org\/package-manager\/","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"We also recommend using this method instead of CocoaPods."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Step 1. Add Package Dependencies in your project.","anchor":"Step-1-Add-Package-Dependencies-in-your-project"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To add a framework to your project, you need to select Add Package Dependencies in the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"File","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" section of the top menu of Xcode:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"fig1.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Paste into the search bar url:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["https:\/\/github.com\/vigram-sw\/SDK_iOS_viDoc_Distribution.git"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"fig2.png"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After entering the address, the SDK name, the current release version, and the project to which the library will be added will appear:"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"fig3.png"}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Make sure you have access to an internet connection and that the project you are adding the framework to is selected correctly","type":"text"},{"t